#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-m8p.rst:11
#: 11c518418e4649d890694ff383168c6d 1764794ae92946a5bca3fff600253a1c
#: 6bc9b69d28e945e986ce7c3b392c14b4 9f529af42e794e789aedc6134f9034a7
#: e724403fdfba4c68b587d6cd83090204
msgid ""
"The `Holybro H-RTK M8P GNSS <http://www.holybro.com/product/h-rtk-m8p-rover-"
"lite/>`_  is an RTK GNSS module for mass market by Holybro. This family is "
"similar to the :ref:`common-holybro-rtk-f9p` family but uses the smaller, "
"lighter, and less expensive M8P Ublox RTK GNSS module which still provides "
"far superior position resolution than previous generations."
msgstr ""
"`Holybro H-RTK M8P GNSS <http://www.holybro.com/product/h-rtk-m8p-rover-"
"lite/>`_ 是 Holybro 面向大众市场推出的 RTK GNSS 模块。该系列与 :ref:`common-holybro-rtk-f9p` "
"系列类似，但采用更小、更轻、更经济的 M8P Ublox RTK GNSS 模块，定位精度仍远优于上一代产品。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-m8p.rst:13
#: 355f6b6d107a4384bd6179ee9912f672 61d794ef18334ea790486d0678711091
#: 63c0305a91e3481e990d7025cddd9964 a256bc0a6a704330914cfdc7f1b197f1
#: c543ddcd408c444097bd2fcd600bfa16
msgid ""
"Using RTK allows ArduPilot to get its position with centimeter-level "
"accuracy, which is much more accurate than can be provided by a normal GPS."
msgstr "使用 RTK 可使 ArduPilot 获得厘米级定位精度，远优于普通 GPS 所能提供的精度。"

